<title>GERMANY: German airmail links to Albania resumed.</title>
<headline>German airmail links to Albania resumed.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Airmail transport between Germany and Albania has been resumed, the German post office said.</p>
<p>Deutsche Post AG was now accepting letters and parcels for Albania again after postal links were interrupted due to the civil unrest there, a statement said.</p>
<p>Only airmail could be carried since surface mail through Hungary and Yugoslavia was still not possible, it added. -- Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom. Tel +44 171 542 7706; Fax: 5017</p>
